a9y18qlte: no fd5 2D blitter on the A512

CP_BLIT copies and fills run but write nothing on the A512 (seen under
kgsl during bring-up, and again for a linear RGBA -> BGRX IOSurface blit
on the phone), so blits go through u_blitter's draws there, as with
FD_MESA_DEBUG=noblit.

--- a/src/gallium/drivers/freedreno/a5xx/fd5_context.c
+++ b/src/gallium/drivers/freedreno/a5xx/fd5_context.c
@@ -73,3 +73,3 @@

-   if (!FD_DBG(NOBLIT))
+   if (!FD_DBG(NOBLIT) && screen->gpu_id != 512)
       fd5_ctx->base.blit = fd5_blitter_blit;
